B  (C) Option C  (D) Option D\n*Answer*: (A) — Standard board-level conceptual check.\n\n**Q15**: Practice question 15 covering core syllabus concepts from Chapter 3.\n(A) Option A  (B) Option B  (C) Option C  (D) Option D\n*Answer*: (A) — Standard board-level conceptual check."}]}'::jsonb,
