  'PDF predicted question bank',
  'Q4. Tenses - Contextual Verb Forms [4 Marks]
Prompt: Fill in the blanks with correct forms of verbs given in brackets (Tenses - 4 Marks):
(a) The train __________ (leave) before we reached the station.
(b) My father __________ (live) in Jaipur since 2015.
(c) Look! The sun __________ (rise) over the hills.
(d) If you work hard, you __________ (pass) the examination.',
  'had left (Past perfect rule: ''had + V3'' before past simple clause ''reached'')',
  '(a) had left (Past perfect rule: ''had + V3'' before past simple clause ''reached'')
(b) has been living / has lived (Present perfect continuous for action starting in past with ''since'')
(c) is rising (Present continuous triggered by ''Look!'')
(d) will pass (First conditional clause: Present simple → Future simple)',
